                                                "sense_id": "ab99e876-ca3f-3b21-bc77-88d46d76a02d",
                                                "text": "Once the floodwaters had receded and further damage inspections could be carried out, the engineering solution [...] was to drill more than 120 sheet piles up to eight metres deep along a 115-metre section of the embankment."
